  ('ja', 'terms', 'terms.restaurants.item2', 'ReserveHub does not endorse any specific restaurant and is not responsible for the quality of food, service, or any dining experience.'),
  ('ko', 'terms', 'terms.restaurants.item2', 'ReserveHub는 특정 레스토랑을 보증하지 않으며 음식, 서비스 또는 식사 경험의 품질에 대해 책임을 지지 않습니다.'),
  ('zh', 'terms', 'terms.restaurants.item2', 'ReserveHub 不认可任何特定餐厅，也不对食品质量、服务或任何用餐体验负责。'),
  ('en', 'terms', 'terms.restaurants.item3', 'Any disputes arising from your dining experience should be resolved directly with the restaurant.'),
  ('es', 'terms', 'terms.restaurants.item3', 'Cualquier disputa que surja de su experiencia gastronómica debe resolverse directamente con el restaurante.'),
  ('de', 'terms', 'terms.restaurants.item3', 'Alle Streitigkeiten, die sich aus Ihrem kulinarischen Erlebnis ergeben, sollten direkt mit dem Restaurant gelöst werden.'),
  ('pt', 'terms', 'terms.restaurants.item3', 'Quaisquer disputas decorrentes da sua experiência gastronómica deverão ser resolvidas diretamente com o restaurante.'),
